# Invite code list. This file is the source of truth; edit it anytime.
#
# Format, one code per line: code[,max_uses][,status]
#   CODE-XXXXXX-YYYYYY            -> unlimited, active
#   CODE-XXXXXX-YYYYYY,100        -> limited to 100 uses, active
#   CODE-XXXXXX-YYYYYY,,revoked   -> revoked
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# After editing, sync it to D1 (only max_uses / status are updated, usage is kept):
#   npm run apply-codes
#
# Copy this file to invite-codes.txt and add your own codes below.

your-invite-code-here
